        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Poison Spray"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The Bonebleacher bugbear is holding a contact or injury poison\n\nThe Bonebleacher bugbear attaches the poison container to a nozzle on their mask, which then sprays the poison from the mask in a 15-foot cone. The bugbear isn't exposed to the poison. All creatures in the cone are immediately exposed to the poison, and each creature must attempt a Fortitude save against the poison."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "2b49615b-e990-496e-b82c-e10fc21f1958",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:13.036939"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Twin Feint"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The Bonebleacher bugbear is wielding two melee weapons, each in a different hand\n\nThe Bonebleacher bugbear makes a dazzling series of attacks with two weapons, using the first attack to throw their foe off-guard against a second attack at a different angle. They make one Strike with each of their two melee weapons, both against the same target. The target is automatically off-guard against the second attack. Apply the bugbear's multiple attack penalty to the Strikes normally."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
